        "dialogs": {
          "$type": "System.Collections.Generic.List`1[[miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp]], mscorlib",
          "$values": [
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_601102_1101947557_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "还偏门，嚯嚯！\n问了几个在航路上跑的朋友才找全。\n{A笑哈哈}但她沉下心来看书，可喜可贺！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_601102_1101947557_content",
                "value": "还偏门，嚯嚯！\n问了几个在航路上跑的朋友才找全。\n{A笑哈哈}但她沉下心来看书，可喜可贺！"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1101947557
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_601102_1101947558_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "所以我准备了一个专用的书箱，\n{A挠头}啊，真是不好意思，\n似乎是这些天下雨淋湿了……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_601102_1101947558_content",
                "value": "所以我准备了一个专用的书箱，\n{A挠头}啊，真是不好意思，\n似乎是这些天下雨淋湿了……"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1101947558
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_601102_1101947559_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "莫急，书都塑封过了，不受影响，\n但还是想请<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>带给艾莎莎尼前，\n用<style=Highlight>手工图桌</style>把<style=Highlight>书箱修复</style>好。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_601102_1101947559_content",
                "value": "莫急，书都塑封过了，不受影响，\n但还是想请<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>带给艾莎莎尼前，\n用<style=Highlight>手工图桌</style>把<style=Highlight>书箱修复</style>好。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1101947559
            },
